  "notes": [
    "The direct runtime fixes token addresses, router and spot-quote validation from creation. One-time enableSwap and address blacklisting gate exposure without changing that pricing logic.",
    "167.305316006695072569 WBNB extracted across six transactions on April 8 and April 14, 2024. Each component is the combined WBNB depletion of the SQUID v1/WBNB and v2/WBNB pools after all same-transaction WBNB inputs, including attacker-supplied principal. Internal swaps between the two pools cancel. The first two transactions pay 5 WBNB each to an external flash lender, retained in gross loss. SQUID reserve transfers, intermediate purchases and burns are not valued again. Each recurrence uses a preceding BNB/USD quote. Gas, builder payments and later recovery do not reduce the measurement."
